{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21527","headline":"与太白同之东洛至栎阳太白染疾驻行予九月二十五日至华岳寺雪後望山 · 元稹","name":"与太白同之东洛至栎阳太白染疾驻行予九月二十五日至华岳寺雪後望山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共作洛阳千里伴，老刘因疾驻行轩。\n今朝独自山前立，雪满三峰倚寺门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}